# The relation editor: select a relation from a member's Relations row, see
# its members highlighted, edit a role, reorder, and undo.
#
# Coordinates (window 1200x800, default 280px side panel, map centre at
# (488, 388), viewport as in relations.osmscript; fixtures/relation-editor.osm
# is laid out for it): way 8202 is clicked at (520, 200). The way's preset Fields
# fill the panel and push the Relations row off screen, so the Fields header
# (y=210) and then the Tags header (y=243, once Fields has collapsed) are
# clicked to collapse them; that puts the Relations row ("Bus 7B") at y=306
# however many preset fields the way has. The collapsed state is kept when the
# relation is selected, so its Members list is already at a fixed place:
# member i has its name row centred at y=332+47.5*i and its role line at
# y=354+47.5*i; the move-down button is at x=1150 and remove at x=1170.
# (The `key m a i n` lines type into the role input.)

window 1200 800
load_osm docs/screenshots/fixtures/relation-editor.osm
viewport 40.7120 -74.0060 18
wait_idle 5s
capture out/relation-editor-01-start.png

click 520,200
wait_idle 2s
assert_selected way 8202
capture out/relation-editor-02-member-way.png

# Collapse Fields and Tags so the Relations row is at a fixed place, then click
# it: that selects the relation and highlights its members.
click 1000,210
wait_idle 1s
click 1000,243
wait_idle 1s
click 1000,306
wait_idle 2s
assert_selected relation 9101
capture out/relation-editor-03-relation-selected.png

wait_idle 2s
capture out/relation-editor-04-members.png

# Edit the second member's role in place: type "main", Enter.
click 1000,402
wait_idle 2s
capture out/relation-editor-05-role-editing.png
key m
key a
key i
key n
key enter
wait_idle 2s
capture out/relation-editor-06-role-edited.png

# Move the first member down one place.
click 1150,332
wait_idle 2s
capture out/relation-editor-07-moved.png

# Undo puts it back.
key cmd+z
wait_idle 2s
capture out/relation-editor-08-move-undone.png

# The context menu of a way offers Add to Relation…
click 340,400
wait_idle 2s
click 340,400 button=right
wait_idle 2s
capture out/relation-editor-09-context-menu.png
log done
